    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it's just hard to see how anything could ever feel real again. like, if the version of me that he loved is just... gone... then what's the point of even trying to \"relearn\" things? it feels like i'm just waiting for my body to catch up to the fact that i'm already not really here.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
