    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing though. what if there isn't a new version? what if there's nothing left to flicker? it's like i'm just a shell of a person. staying here and trying to \"honor signals\" just feels like performing a role for a life that ended months ago. it's exhausting to keep pretending there's a person inside this body.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
